        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "I’ve been very pleased with the service provided by Antoine Nasry. He is highly knowledgeable and efficient, especially when it comes to the tax return process.\nAntoine takes the time to explain everything clearly, ensures all details are accurate, and always files on time. His professionalism and attention to detail make the entire experience stress-free. I truly appreciate his support and expertise—highly recommended!",
        "time": 1743862428,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Benjamin Ohayon",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112108949130359512015/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIGLLLrYjR-VPv1Tb_P64N-FsMSs0mq96ntg6EDjpFhsGlsZg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "M. Nasry has been taking care of my Corporate taxes, GST/PST and Personal Taxes for over 1 year now. Communication is flawless, the level of knowledge of M. Nasry is far superior than what I have experienced in the past. I highly recommend M Antoine Nasry, CPA!",
        "time": 1738695299,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Pierre Kitts",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114158889600967729904/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVdSZlZ65hOyGPsuWXmx7UEkcR8UzurKPiXgpdHt17ZKzXb9TnG=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I have been dealing with Antoine for 10 yeras now since I started my small business and I must say that he is always available, and has great insight specially if you use Quickbooks. I save quite a bit just on the Coprate tax filling he does, as well as any dividends that need to be filled. If you are a small business you are in great hands. The great part is that he does individual tax reporting for those who need just that. So if you need personal taxes or corporate he is your go to Chartered Accountant.",
        "time": 1709918297,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
